2. Gauge will execute each test scenario, and when a scenario-defined step (<step in StepDefinitions>)

    - fails to execute, the execution will halt with an error message
    - completes successfully, Gauge will continue executing other scenarios.

3. When the test execution is successful, the test output will indicate the test pass/fail status.

