         return done(null, payload);
       } catch (err) {
         return done(err);
       }
     })
   );
   ```

   This implementation simply verifies the provided JWT token using the `jsonwebtoken` library and the secret key from your `.env` file. If successful, it returns the decoded payload (i.e., user information) to Passport.

